{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-element-sobha-realty-sobha-hartland","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":74,"crm_id":"1639","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"The Element","slug":"the-element-sobha-realty-sobha-hartland","display_address":"Sobha Hartland","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Sobha Realty","price":1820000,"display_price":"1.82M","lattitude":25.18237,"longitude":55.336619,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Element at Sobha One by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-sobha-realty/\">Sobha Realty</a> is a striking new addition to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/sobha-hartland/\">Sobha Hartland</a>, redefining luxury with its elegant design and breathtaking views. This architectural masterpiece offers a curated collection of 1 to 4-bedroom apartments. With 69 floors of meticulously crafted residences, The Element provides direct access to Ras Al Khor Highway, ensuring seamless connectivity to Downtown Dubai, Dubai Creek, and beyond. Residents will enjoy world-class amenities, including exclusive clubhouse access, lush open spaces, and an 18-hole pitch and putt golf course, the first of its kind in Dubai. &nbsp;</p><p>Set against the backdrop of Dubai’s most stunning vistas—Creek Harbour, Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary, and the Dubai skyline—The Element in Sobha Hartland blends urban elegance with serene natural beauty. &nbsp;With a flexible payment plan, The Element apartments at Sobha One present an exceptional opportunity for investors and homeowners alike.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Element_feature_d007d26488.jpg","has