-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Element_sp_73579df9b0.jpg","hash":"The_Element_sp_73579df9b0","name":"The-Element-sp.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"The Element at Sobha One – Redefining Luxury with Iconic Views & Unmatched Elegance","heading":"UNIQUE SELLING POINTS","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Location: The Element by Sobha Group at Sobha One is situated in Sobha Hartland, offering seamless access to Downtown Dubai, Dubai Creek, and Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary.</li><li>Exclusive Living Spaces: Thoughtfully designed 1 to 4-bedroom apartments with modern aesthetics, open layouts, and floor-to-ceiling windows.</li><li>Panoramic Views: Enjoy 270° panoramic views of the Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary, Dubai’s iconic skyline, and a world-class golf course.</li><li>Luxury Amenities: Resort-style pools, clubhouse, landscaped gardens, outdoor lounges, yoga decks, kids' play areas, and wellness zones.</li><li>Strong Investment Potential: Flexible 60/40 payment plan, competitive pricing, and a high-demand location make The Element a lucrative investment opportunity.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1351,"cta":{"id":2120,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Element_map_7f18644e0f.jpg","hash":"The_Element_map_7f18644e0f","name":"The Element by Sobha Realty Map"},"style":null,"title":"The Element at Sobha One – Where Luxury Meets Limitless Views","heading":"LOCATION","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The Element by Sobha Group at Sobha One is perfectly positioned in Sobha Hartland, offering effortless connectivity to Dubai’s key destinations. With direct access to major highways, residents enjoy seamless travel to Downtown Dubai, Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary, and premier lifestyle hubs. The Element in Sobha Hartland places you moments away from world-class shopping, fine dining, and cultural landmarks. As one of the most sought-after new off-plan properties in Sobha Hartland, it combines urban convenience with natural tranquility.</p><ul><li>5 Minutes to Dubai Creek Harbour</li><li>10 Minutes to Downtown Dubai</li><li>10 Minutes to Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary</li><li>15 Minutes to Palm Jumeirah</li><li>15 Minutes to Dubai Marina</li><li>20 Minutes to Dubai International Airport</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3643,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Element_at_Sobha_One_892d0456f5.pdf","hash":"The_Element_at_Sobha_One_892d0456f5","name":"The Element by Sobha Realty Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":null,"floor_plans":[{"id":3242,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"From 730 sq. ft.","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Element_bed_1_0fe02a3326.jpg","hash":"The_Element_bed_1_0fe02a3326","name":"The Element by Sobha Realty Floorplan"},"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3243,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"From 1,184 sq. ft.","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Element_bed_2_3b271132a7.jpg","hash":"The_Element_bed_2_3b271132a7","name":"The Element by Sobha Realty Floorplan"},"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment ","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3244,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"From 1,854 sq. ft.","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/The_Element_bed_3_d1fd8021ee.jpg","hash":"The_Element_bed_3_d1fd8021ee","name":"The