Sobha Group","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"The Element by Sobha at Sobha One presents 1-4 bedroom apartments in Sobha Hartland, blending urban luxury with serene views, top-tier amenities, and prime connectivity."},"more_info":[{"id":5238,"answer":"<p>The Element by Sobha offers 1 to 4-bedroom apartments, ranging from 730 sq. ft. to 2,445 sq. ft., designed with modern finishes and panoramic views of Dubai’s skyline, Creek Harbour, and Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of apartments are available at The Element at Sobha One?"},{"id":5239,"answer":"<p>The payment plan of The Element at Sobha One follows a 60/40 structure, with 60% payable during construction and 40% upon completion, which is expected in Q4 2028.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan for The Element by Sobha?"},{"id":5240,"answer":"<ul><li>1-Bedroom: From AED 1.82M (730-750 sq. ft.)</li><li>2-Bedroom: From AED 3.05M (1,184 - 1,517 sq. ft.)</li><li>3-Bedroom: From AED 4.73M (1,854 - 1,959 sq. ft.)</li><li>4-Bedroom: From AED 6.43M (2,445 sq. ft.)</li></ul>","question":"What are the starting prices for The Element apartments in Sobha Hartland?"},{"id":5241,"answer":"<p>Residents enjoy world-class amenities, including a clubhouse, infinity pools, kids' play areas, fitness zones, yoga decks, outdoor lounges, and Dubai’s first-ever 18-hole pitch and putt golf course.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are available at The Element by Sobha Group at Sobha One?"},{"id":5242,"answer":"<p>As one of the new off-plan properties in Sobha Hartland, The Element offers prime location, high rental yields, capital appreciation, a flexible payment plan, and exclusive luxury living, making it an excellent investment opportunity.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Why should I invest in The Element at Sobha One?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":null,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://gg